1
00:01:30,340 --> 00:01:33,578
=Against The Current=

2
00:01:33,579 --> 00:01:35,000
(Adapted from He Yanshan's novel,
Orchid Fragrance Fate)

3
00:01:35,180 --> 00:01:36,920
=Episode 25=
(This drama does not correspond)

4
00:01:36,930 --> 00:01:38,200
(to any real historical dynasty.)

5
00:01:38,210 --> 00:01:41,160
(The systems, culture, attire and other
dynastic elements have been adapted.)

6
00:01:41,820 --> 00:01:42,740
Zheng Baichuan!

7
00:01:43,900 --> 00:01:45,059
Are you trying to rebel?

8
00:01:46,300 --> 00:01:48,059
You insolent fool,
spouting such nonsense!

9
00:01:48,580 --> 00:01:49,779
His Majesty is gravely ill

10
00:01:50,168 --> 00:01:51,740
and has passed the throne to Prince Han.

11
00:01:54,619 --> 00:01:56,059
By His Majesty's command,

12
00:01:56,248 --> 00:01:57,752
I am here to execute the traitors.

13
00:01:58,139 --> 00:01:59,059
Nonsense!

14
00:01:59,419 --> 00:02:01,219
You're the one spouting lies,

15
00:02:01,460 --> 00:02:02,660
trying to turn Prince Han

16
00:02:02,660 --> 00:02:04,259
against his brother, the Crown Prince.

17
00:02:15,210 --> 00:02:16,504
Thank you both for your help.

18
00:02:17,300 --> 00:02:18,539
That was terrifying.

19
00:02:20,460 --> 00:02:21,300
My clothes are thick.

20
00:02:23,100 --> 00:02:24,059
It's only a flesh wound.

21
00:02:29,619 --> 00:02:30,460
Impossible.

22
00:02:30,860 --> 00:02:32,700
I clearly heard
the Crown Prince speaking.

23
00:02:32,930 --> 00:02:35,064
I saw the Crown Prince
go onstage with my own eyes!

24
00:02:36,499 --> 00:02:38,740
It was merely ventriloquism.

25
00:02:38,939 --> 00:02:41,980
Just a trick to amuse the nobles.

26
00:02:42,659 --> 00:02:44,580
His Highness has already
left for the capital

27
00:02:44,580 --> 00:02:45,580
on His Majesty's orders.

28
00:02:50,020 --> 00:02:50,779
Chengze.

29
00:02:51,020 --> 00:02:53,099
You should offer
your brother-in-law a proper toast.

30
00:02:56,050 --> 00:02:57,320
Thank you for your help today.

31
00:02:57,939 --> 00:02:58,580
We're family.

32
00:02:58,860 --> 00:02:59,580
It's only right.

33
00:03:02,619 --> 00:03:03,420
You may go.

34
00:03:06,099 --> 00:03:07,300
I want to take the stage.

35
00:03:07,819 --> 00:03:09,460
Even Duke Xianguo has agreed.

36
00:03:09,700 --> 00:03:12,219
Duke Xianguo, it's time for me
to change into my costume.

37
00:03:15,100 --> 00:03:16,100
Take care, Commander Lin.

38
00:03:16,110 --> 00:03:17,350
We're here to escort the bride.

39
00:03:17,499 --> 00:03:19,099
Take care, Commander Liu.

40
00:03:19,819 --> 00:03:20,580
Liu Xiaochuan.

41
00:03:20,648 --> 00:03:22,360
Don't you dare throw up in my carriage.

42
00:03:28,700 --> 00:03:29,499
All right.

43
00:03:29,880 --> 00:03:32,310
Even if they manage to slip out
of the Marquis's Residence,

44
00:03:32,420 --> 00:03:34,460
they won't get out of Jinling City!

45
00:03:35,219 --> 00:03:35,860
Kill them!

46
00:03:36,659 --> 00:03:37,260
Kill them!

47
00:03:37,499 --> 00:03:39,180
Kill them all!

48
00:03:40,219 --> 00:03:40,539
Go!

49
00:03:48,219 --> 00:03:49,020
Hurry, Manyi!

50
00:03:49,219 --> 00:03:50,260
They're killing people!

51
00:03:50,900 --> 00:03:52,619
Hurry!

52
00:03:54,580 --> 00:03:55,619
Hurry!

53
00:03:56,099 --> 00:03:57,020
Go!

54
00:04:14,020 --> 00:04:14,900
Kill them!

55
00:04:15,460 --> 00:04:16,260
You go on ahead.

56
00:04:16,700 --> 00:04:17,380
Go!

57
00:04:22,299 --> 00:04:22,779
This way!

58
00:04:41,288 --> 00:04:43,460
By order of His Highness,
we're leaving the city.

59
00:04:43,480 --> 00:04:44,770
Open the city gate immediately!

60
00:04:44,824 --> 00:04:46,280
Anyone who disobeys will be executed!

61
00:04:46,339 --> 00:04:48,390
(Shence Gate)
Without Duke Xianguo's written order,

62
00:04:48,400 --> 00:04:50,088
even if His Highness came in person,

63
00:04:50,140 --> 00:04:52,310
he still wouldn't be allowed
to leave the city tonight!

64
00:05:01,000 --> 00:05:03,020
By order of His Highness,
we're leaving the city!

65
00:05:03,460 --> 00:05:05,176
(Decree)
Open the city gate immediately!

66
00:05:05,272 --> 00:05:06,920
Anyone who disobeys will be executed!

67
00:05:11,820 --> 00:05:12,620
Open the gate!

68
00:05:14,140 --> 00:05:15,060
- Make way!
- Make way!

69
00:05:21,368 --> 00:05:23,880
The sooner His Highness
returns to the capital, the better.

70
00:05:23,900 --> 00:05:26,280
With swift horses, the overland route
would be faster.

71
00:05:26,299 --> 00:05:28,020
Prince Han once followed His Majesty

72
00:05:28,500 --> 00:05:30,339
from Tongzhou all the way to Jinling,

73
00:05:30,539 --> 00:05:32,460
so he knows this route very well.

74
00:05:32,460 --> 00:05:33,820
Now that he commands the troops,

75
00:05:33,820 --> 00:05:35,150
if he sets ambushes along the way,

76
00:05:35,192 --> 00:05:36,140
even the swiftest horses

77
00:05:36,280 --> 00:05:37,850
would have no hope of getting through.

78
00:05:37,940 --> 00:05:39,320
Traveling by water may seem slower,

79
00:05:39,339 --> 00:05:40,620
but from Jinling to Yangzhou,

80
00:05:40,620 --> 00:05:42,140
(Jinling - Yangzhou)
your Naval Camp can escort him,

81
00:05:42,150 --> 00:05:43,370
making it safer than traveling overland.

82
00:05:43,380 --> 00:05:44,140
Your Highness.

83
00:05:44,200 --> 00:05:45,170
Hold on a little longer.

84
00:05:45,419 --> 00:05:46,380
Once we reach Wuma Ferry,

85
00:05:46,500 --> 00:05:48,380
we'll be safe aboard
the ship Chengze arranged.

86
00:05:49,539 --> 00:05:50,219
I'm fine.

87
00:05:50,940 --> 00:05:51,900
Full speed ahead.

88
00:05:52,060 --> 00:05:53,339
But from Yangzhou to the capital,

89
00:05:53,340 --> 00:05:54,730
how can we ensure His Highness's safety?

90
00:05:54,740 --> 00:05:56,890
I once saved Luo Dalang,
Leader of the Boatmen's Guild.

91
00:05:57,020 --> 00:05:57,859
If this works out,

92
00:05:59,099 --> 00:06:00,419
this canal will be yours

93
00:06:01,219 --> 00:06:02,380
to command from now on.

94
00:06:05,299 --> 00:06:07,020
Fortune favors the bold.

95
00:06:07,480 --> 00:06:08,690
Then I'll bring my trusted men

96
00:06:08,700 --> 00:06:10,830
and the Boatmen's Guild's best men
to escort him all the way.

97
00:06:10,840 --> 00:06:12,840
We'll make sure
he returns to the capital in time.

98
00:06:42,260 --> 00:06:43,859
Xu Lanxiang.

99
00:06:50,859 --> 00:06:52,700
I underestimated you.

100
00:06:53,060 --> 00:06:54,060
Tell me.

101
00:06:54,900 --> 00:06:57,179
Did you conspire with Lin Jinqi

102
00:06:57,179 --> 00:06:58,620
to plot against my father and me?

103
00:06:58,620 --> 00:06:59,299
No.

104
00:07:00,140 --> 00:07:00,979
Absolutely not.

105
00:07:02,700 --> 00:07:03,900
My original plan was

106
00:07:04,728 --> 00:07:06,824
to lure Old Madam Yuan
and the other ladies over

107
00:07:07,219 --> 00:07:09,219
when you came to catch the ghost,

108
00:07:09,288 --> 00:07:10,600
so they could hear the truth.

109
00:07:13,020 --> 00:07:13,659
I never expected

110
00:07:13,820 --> 00:07:15,820
His Highness to suddenly
play the Mountain Deity,

111
00:07:16,536 --> 00:07:18,664
so I simply
took advantage of the opportunity.

112
00:07:19,576 --> 00:07:21,460
I didn't know
Young Master Lin and the others

113
00:07:21,460 --> 00:07:24,339
would use a decoy Crown Prince in place
of the real one to play it.

114
00:07:24,820 --> 00:07:25,979
Lanxiang truly didn't know.

115
00:07:26,360 --> 00:07:28,090
If she'd known
about Commander Lin's plan,

116
00:07:28,099 --> 00:07:28,820
she would've slipped away.

117
00:07:28,820 --> 00:07:30,390
She never would've put herself in danger

118
00:07:30,408 --> 00:07:33,060
by going anywhere near the
Mountain Deity and ending up like this.

119
00:08:00,419 --> 00:08:03,260
Lin Jinqi didn't care
whether you lived or died either.

120
00:08:05,560 --> 00:08:08,168
That was all a misunderstanding
on your part, Young Lady Zheng.

121
00:08:08,419 --> 00:08:09,460
That pot of orchids

122
00:08:09,832 --> 00:08:11,620
was given to me
by Young Master Lin's maid.

123
00:08:11,720 --> 00:08:13,608
Young Master Lin merely passed it along.

124
00:08:18,539 --> 00:08:20,339
That's what men are like.

125
00:08:22,419 --> 00:08:24,020
That's what men are like.

126
00:08:25,060 --> 00:08:27,339
All they care about is power.

127
00:08:31,460 --> 00:08:32,380
Young Lady Zheng.

128
00:08:32,536 --> 00:08:33,992
Since it was all a misunderstanding,

129
00:08:35,020 --> 00:08:36,860
there's no need for us to fall out

130
00:08:36,860 --> 00:08:37,900
over a wretched man.

131
00:08:38,100 --> 00:08:39,380
Put down the blade.

132
00:08:39,779 --> 00:08:40,980
I'll withdraw my testimony.

133
00:08:41,260 --> 00:08:42,100
From now on,

134
00:08:42,260 --> 00:08:43,819
we'll each go our separate ways.

135
00:08:44,184 --> 00:08:45,900
We'll pretend
none of this ever happened.

136
00:08:46,419 --> 00:08:47,620
In your dreams!

137
00:08:49,900 --> 00:08:51,020
Don't blame me.

138
00:08:52,100 --> 00:08:54,539
Lin Jinqi is the one who got you killed.

139
00:08:57,579 --> 00:08:58,100
Run!

140
00:08:58,579 --> 00:08:59,340
Xu Lanxiang!

141
00:09:31,380 --> 00:09:32,260
What are you doing?

142
00:09:32,419 --> 00:09:33,220
Xu Lanxiang!

143
00:09:33,340 --> 00:09:34,220
Let go of me!

144
00:09:35,699 --> 00:09:37,100
What are you doing? Let go of me!

145
00:09:47,860 --> 00:09:50,100
His Highness has safely left Jinling

146
00:09:50,179 --> 00:09:51,539
and is on his way to the capital!

147
00:09:51,699 --> 00:09:54,140
His Highness has safely left Jinling

148
00:09:54,220 --> 00:09:55,620
and is on his way to the capital!

149
00:09:55,740 --> 00:09:58,299
His Highness has safely left Jinling

150
00:09:58,539 --> 00:10:00,459
and is on his way to the capital!

151
00:10:45,340 --> 00:10:46,699
Why surrender?

152
00:10:55,620 --> 00:10:57,100
Why surrender?

153
00:11:02,020 --> 00:11:03,500
We've already gone this far.

154
00:11:04,100 --> 00:11:05,779
Why surrender?

155
00:12:04,100 --> 00:12:05,419
My parents are easily frightened.

156
00:12:05,420 --> 00:12:06,490
What happened last night...

157
00:12:06,536 --> 00:12:08,530
Last night, we stayed with the troupe.

158
00:12:17,299 --> 00:12:18,020
Mother!

159
00:12:26,419 --> 00:12:26,980
Mother!

160
00:12:29,900 --> 00:12:30,819
Mother!

161
00:12:40,299 --> 00:12:41,020
Mother!

162
00:12:41,740 --> 00:12:42,659
Grandpa Tu!

163
00:12:46,860 --> 00:12:48,939
Father. Mister Lu.

164
00:12:49,179 --> 00:12:50,020
Lanxiang.

165
00:12:51,299 --> 00:12:53,740
This calls for a celebratory drink.

166
00:12:54,579 --> 00:12:56,140
When did you get back?

167
00:12:57,059 --> 00:12:58,220
We arrived last night.

168
00:12:58,520 --> 00:13:00,340
We saw the city gates open this morning,

169
00:13:00,340 --> 00:13:00,980
so we came back.

170
00:13:10,260 --> 00:13:11,059
It's you?

171
00:13:12,819 --> 00:13:13,299
I...

172
00:13:13,900 --> 00:13:14,939
My name is Zhi.

173
00:13:16,059 --> 00:13:17,900
Mister Lu and Uncle Xu

174
00:13:18,380 --> 00:13:20,140
bought my freedom from Qingyan House.

175
00:13:22,779 --> 00:13:23,579
That's wonderful.

176
00:13:24,459 --> 00:13:25,140
Where's Ji'er?

177
00:13:25,340 --> 00:13:26,220
Is she inside?

178
00:13:27,659 --> 00:13:28,140
Lanxiang.

179
00:13:28,900 --> 00:13:29,819
Come, sit down.

180
00:13:30,059 --> 00:13:31,419
Sit down and listen to Mister Lu.

181
00:13:34,179 --> 00:13:34,659
Sit.

182
00:13:38,380 --> 00:13:39,299
Sit down, Zhi.

183
00:13:48,860 --> 00:13:51,020
By the time we reached Qingyan House,

184
00:13:52,220 --> 00:13:52,900
Ji'er

185
00:13:53,419 --> 00:13:55,740
had already been sold by the madam

186
00:13:55,740 --> 00:13:57,779
to a traveling merchant
passing through Yangzhou.

187
00:14:00,179 --> 00:14:01,059
That same day,

188
00:14:02,260 --> 00:14:04,860
the merchant left Yangzhou.

189
00:14:23,579 --> 00:14:24,579
It's all my fault.

190
00:14:25,539 --> 00:14:27,179
I dragged Ji'er into this.

191
00:14:28,500 --> 00:14:29,939
If she hadn't saved me,

192
00:14:30,500 --> 00:14:32,220
the madam wouldn't have sold her.

193
00:14:34,220 --> 00:14:35,020
It's not your fault.

194
00:14:35,720 --> 00:14:37,144
It's my fault for being so useless.

195
00:14:37,220 --> 00:14:39,500
What good does it do to talk like that?

196
00:14:40,740 --> 00:14:42,140
Where there's a will, there's a way.

197
00:14:45,860 --> 00:14:46,659
Right.

198
00:14:47,980 --> 00:14:50,140
We need to find that merchant first

199
00:14:50,220 --> 00:14:51,179
and bring Ji'er back.

200
00:14:52,819 --> 00:14:55,059
Do you know the merchant's name,

201
00:14:55,100 --> 00:14:56,059
where he's from,

202
00:14:56,500 --> 00:14:57,779
or what business he's in?

203
00:14:58,659 --> 00:15:00,939
The madam only met him once,

204
00:15:01,320 --> 00:15:02,690
so she couldn't tell us anything.

205
00:15:03,140 --> 00:15:04,860
All she knew was that he was wealthy.

206
00:15:05,459 --> 00:15:06,220
Shuang...

207
00:15:07,980 --> 00:15:09,819
When Young Lady Ji'er left,

208
00:15:10,179 --> 00:15:11,500
I was hanging clothes out to dry.

209
00:15:12,020 --> 00:15:14,340
There was a brand
on the merchant's mule.

210
00:15:14,620 --> 00:15:15,860
I took a closer look

211
00:15:16,380 --> 00:15:17,419
and remembered it.

212
00:15:18,900 --> 00:15:19,900
Mister Lu drew this

213
00:15:20,500 --> 00:15:23,100
based on Zhi's description.

214
00:15:24,260 --> 00:15:25,500
That merchant

215
00:15:25,740 --> 00:15:27,620
went to Yangzhou once,

216
00:15:28,020 --> 00:15:30,059
so he may well go there again.

217
00:15:31,299 --> 00:15:33,539
I've already asked
my friends in Yangzhou

218
00:15:33,699 --> 00:15:35,020
to keep an eye out.

219
00:15:36,340 --> 00:15:38,459
A mule that large wandering around

220
00:15:38,779 --> 00:15:40,500
with such an obvious brand

221
00:15:40,620 --> 00:15:41,980
is bound to be noticed by someone.

222
00:15:42,819 --> 00:15:44,179
We'll keep asking around.

223
00:15:50,860 --> 00:15:52,220
No matter where she is,

224
00:15:52,740 --> 00:15:54,539
I will find Ji'er.

225
00:15:58,140 --> 00:15:59,059
Thank you.

226
00:15:59,220 --> 00:15:59,980
Zhi.

227
00:16:02,939 --> 00:16:04,419
I'm the one who should thank you.

228
00:16:05,140 --> 00:16:06,779
You rescued me from that terrible place.

229
00:16:07,260 --> 00:16:08,299
Sit down, Zhi.

230
00:16:10,340 --> 00:16:12,100
Zhi is covered in injuries.

231
00:16:12,500 --> 00:16:14,340
It breaks my heart to see her like this.

232
00:16:15,500 --> 00:16:17,819
So Mister Lu and I discussed it

233
00:16:18,380 --> 00:16:19,860
and paid twenty taels of silver

234
00:16:20,140 --> 00:16:21,579
to buy her freedom.

235
00:16:23,459 --> 00:16:24,539
Once I get home,

236
00:16:25,340 --> 00:16:26,664
I'll definitely pay you back.

237
00:16:29,659 --> 00:16:30,500
There's no need.

238
00:16:33,340 --> 00:16:34,620
Once you're home,

239
00:16:35,020 --> 00:16:36,500
live a good life.

240
00:16:37,059 --> 00:16:38,419
If you ever need anything,

241
00:16:39,579 --> 00:16:41,220
you can come to us.

242
00:16:45,860 --> 00:16:46,500
Seventh Master.

243
00:16:47,380 --> 00:16:48,340
The carriage is ready.

244
00:16:48,620 --> 00:16:49,459
Young Lady Zhi,

245
00:16:49,539 --> 00:16:50,299
you can leave now.

246
00:17:10,259 --> 00:17:12,580
Thank you, Mister Lu and Uncle Xu.

247
00:17:12,739 --> 00:17:13,820
You saved my life.

248
00:17:14,459 --> 00:17:15,179
No.

249
00:17:15,179 --> 00:17:16,019
Get up.

250
00:17:16,019 --> 00:17:16,979
Get up, Zhi.

251
00:17:17,259 --> 00:17:17,699
Come.

252
00:17:26,100 --> 00:17:27,192
You should get going.

253
00:17:35,660 --> 00:17:41,180
♪The wind scatters the clouds,
and rain turns to mud♪

254
00:17:41,620 --> 00:17:46,740
♪Memories of the past rise in my heart♪

255
00:17:48,419 --> 00:17:48,900
(Ji'er.)

256
00:17:49,340 --> 00:17:50,820
(I'll come back and buy your freedom.)

257
00:17:52,259 --> 00:17:53,019
(All right.)

258
00:17:54,300 --> 00:17:55,304
(I'll wait for you.)

259
00:17:58,380 --> 00:17:59,499
Thinking about Ji'er?

260
00:18:01,620 --> 00:18:04,060
I hope that merchant is a good man

261
00:18:05,219 --> 00:18:06,459
and treats Ji'er well.

262
00:18:10,860 --> 00:18:12,419
I think the hardest thing in life

263
00:18:13,419 --> 00:18:15,100
is having nothing to hope for.

264
00:18:16,380 --> 00:18:18,179
As long as
there's something to hope for,

265
00:18:18,580 --> 00:18:21,340
you can endure any hardship.

266
00:18:24,659 --> 00:18:26,179
Ji'er must know in her heart

267
00:18:26,300 --> 00:18:27,699
that you'll find her.

268
00:18:28,459 --> 00:18:30,219
So she'll surely stay strong

269
00:18:31,219 --> 00:18:32,300
and wait for you.

270
00:18:37,340 --> 00:18:39,860
♪I watch the passing years wear away♪

271
00:18:39,860 --> 00:18:43,500
♪Even deep affection slowly fades♪

272
00:18:43,500 --> 00:18:50,380
♪The past falls like
withered leaves into the dust♪

273
00:18:55,540 --> 00:18:56,340
Eat some more.

274
00:19:05,900 --> 00:19:06,979
Now that Uncle Xu is back,

275
00:19:07,699 --> 00:19:08,259
Mother,

276
00:19:08,780 --> 00:19:09,860
ask the matchmaker to hurry

277
00:19:10,040 --> 00:19:12,488
and propose to the Xu family
as soon as possible.

278
00:19:14,019 --> 00:19:15,259
Silly boy.

279
00:19:15,340 --> 00:19:17,620
Marriage arrangements can't be rushed.

280
00:19:18,376 --> 00:19:20,540
Before she visits,
she needs to consult the almanac

281
00:19:20,540 --> 00:19:21,900
and choose an auspicious day.

282
00:19:28,300 --> 00:19:28,820
His Majesty

283
00:19:29,580 --> 00:19:30,699
may not have much time left.

284
00:19:33,179 --> 00:19:35,540
When that happens,
we'll have to observe national mourning,

285
00:19:35,960 --> 00:19:37,288
and marriages will be forbidden.

286
00:19:37,860 --> 00:19:39,140
I hold an official degree,

287
00:19:39,608 --> 00:19:42,344
so it's possible I won't be allowed
to discuss marriage for a year.

288
00:19:45,820 --> 00:19:47,140
You have a point.

289
00:19:49,860 --> 00:19:50,300
Then

290
00:19:50,979 --> 00:19:52,739
I'll speak to the matchmaker today

291
00:19:52,860 --> 00:19:54,019
and have her choose

292
00:19:54,019 --> 00:19:55,419
the earliest auspicious day.

293
00:19:57,340 --> 00:19:58,140
Thank you, Mother.

294
00:19:59,540 --> 00:20:01,499
Whenever I brought up marriage before,

295
00:20:01,499 --> 00:20:03,060
no amount of urging could persuade you.

296
00:20:03,410 --> 00:20:06,712
Now you act as though you're
afraid your bride will slip away.

297
00:20:07,699 --> 00:20:09,540
Why are you suddenly in such a hurry?

298
00:20:11,780 --> 00:20:12,820
Don't worry.

299
00:20:13,060 --> 00:20:14,419
Lanxiang's mother and I

300
00:20:14,580 --> 00:20:16,739
have already
discussed nearly everything.

301
00:20:16,860 --> 00:20:19,699
All that's left is for the matchmaker
to make it official.

302
00:20:21,336 --> 00:20:22,936
No one knows what the future may bring.

303
00:20:23,019 --> 00:20:25,060
It never hurts to be cautious.

304
00:20:26,380 --> 00:20:27,060
Yes.

305
00:20:35,740 --> 00:20:39,820
(The Capital)

306
00:20:52,019 --> 00:20:52,939
Crown Prince.

307
00:20:56,300 --> 00:20:57,699
Crown Prince.

308
00:20:58,900 --> 00:21:00,300
Crown Prince.

309
00:21:03,620 --> 00:21:06,380
The imperial decree summoning
His Highness back to the capital

310
00:21:06,939 --> 00:21:08,939
was sent to Jinling by urgent courier.

311
00:21:09,128 --> 00:21:11,496
(Zhao Jin, Zhao Xingtang's Grandfather)
It's been exactly thirty-one days.

312
00:21:11,500 --> 00:21:12,710
(First-Rank)
By my reckoning,

313
00:21:12,728 --> 00:21:15,960
(Junior Guardian and Minister of Personnel)
His Highness should have returned long ago.

314
00:21:20,019 --> 00:21:20,820
Father.

315
00:21:21,352 --> 00:21:23,352
(Prince Han)
My brother must

316
00:21:23,360 --> 00:21:24,690
have been delayed by something.

317
00:21:25,820 --> 00:21:27,100
Please wait a little longer.

318
00:21:33,140 --> 00:21:33,979
You...

319
00:21:35,300 --> 00:21:36,780
You beast!

320
00:21:38,980 --> 00:21:41,620
(Xie Shilian, Second-Rank,
Junior Tutor to the Crown Prince)

321
00:21:45,060 --> 00:21:46,459
You...

322
00:21:48,140 --> 00:21:48,739
Father.

323
00:21:49,419 --> 00:21:51,179
You beast!

324
00:21:51,300 --> 00:21:52,140
Father.

325
00:21:52,540 --> 00:21:53,699
What did you say?

326
00:21:54,659 --> 00:21:55,939
I understand.

327
00:21:56,179 --> 00:21:59,219
I will shoulder this responsibility.

328
00:22:06,060 --> 00:22:06,860
Father.

329
00:22:07,620 --> 00:22:10,259
The Crown Prince has returned!

330
00:22:13,540 --> 00:22:14,739
Your Majesty!

331
00:22:15,499 --> 00:22:18,499
His Highness has returned!

332
00:22:24,499 --> 00:22:25,979
Summon him.

333
00:22:35,699 --> 00:22:36,300
Father.

334
00:22:36,860 --> 00:22:37,820
I'm back.

335
00:22:50,659 --> 00:22:53,699
To preserve and carry on
what has been entrusted to you,

336
00:22:55,780 --> 00:22:57,459
always remain reverent and vigilant.

337
00:22:58,419 --> 00:23:02,780
Take as your own our ancestors'
concern for all under Heaven,

338
00:23:03,459 --> 00:23:05,780
and you shall forever retain
the Mandate of Heaven.

339
00:23:06,219 --> 00:23:07,100
I will remember.

340
00:23:08,380 --> 00:23:11,019
Take as my own our ancestors'
concern for all under Heaven.

341
00:23:23,140 --> 00:23:23,860
Father.

342
00:23:25,739 --> 00:23:28,419
Father!

343
00:23:29,739 --> 00:23:33,179
Father!

344
00:23:36,380 --> 00:23:38,340
Father!

345
00:23:54,060 --> 00:23:58,699
(Imperial Princes,
Regional Princes, and Princesses)

346
00:23:59,100 --> 00:24:00,936
(shall wear
the severest mourning attire)

347
00:24:01,780 --> 00:24:03,459
(for twenty-seven days.)

348
00:24:05,380 --> 00:24:08,540
(All subjects under Heaven
shall mourn for three days)

349
00:24:08,696 --> 00:24:10,450
(and then put off
their mourning attire,)

350
00:24:11,650 --> 00:24:13,752
(so as not to disrupt
the people's livelihoods)

351
00:24:14,179 --> 00:24:15,580
(or interfere with marriages.)

352
00:24:59,580 --> 00:25:01,860
(Your unfilial daughter, Shen Jialan,)

353
00:25:03,739 --> 00:25:06,459
(respectfully informs
parents and grandparents,)

354
00:25:06,568 --> 00:25:08,504
(and all her relatives
of the Shen family,)

355
00:25:09,368 --> 00:25:11,848
(that the man who ordered
the execution of the Shen family)

356
00:25:12,780 --> 00:25:13,739
(is dead.)

357
00:25:28,820 --> 00:25:30,780
I'll burn
some paper offerings for you, too.

358
00:26:15,780 --> 00:26:17,259
I smelled smoke

359
00:26:19,580 --> 00:26:21,580
and thought there was a fire somewhere.

360
00:26:24,419 --> 00:26:26,380
Who are you burning paper offerings for?

361
00:26:26,860 --> 00:26:28,060
Mister Lu...

362
00:26:29,300 --> 00:26:30,739
The late Emperor left a final decree

363
00:26:31,540 --> 00:26:32,380
forbidding

364
00:26:33,340 --> 00:26:36,380
any burden on the people
or wasteful spending on his funeral.

365
00:26:37,900 --> 00:26:39,019
All our neighbors

366
00:26:39,459 --> 00:26:42,620
have praised the late Emperor
for caring for his people.

367
00:26:43,340 --> 00:26:44,820
So we're just paying our respects.

368
00:26:45,580 --> 00:26:46,580
Mister Lu, would you like

369
00:26:47,080 --> 00:26:49,528
to offer some incense
and burn some paper offerings?

370
00:26:57,100 --> 00:26:59,340
Because he rebelled
and proclaimed himself Emperor,

371
00:27:02,179 --> 00:27:05,780
I'm the only one left alive
in the Lu family.

372
00:27:08,780 --> 00:27:11,179
Offer incense and burn paper for him?

373
00:27:16,219 --> 00:27:20,459
I'd rather clap my hands

374
00:27:20,540 --> 00:27:22,939
and celebrate his death.

375
00:27:53,019 --> 00:27:53,699
Mister Lu...

376
00:27:53,816 --> 00:27:56,440
We're paying respects
to Grand Secretary Shen and his family.

377
00:27:59,259 --> 00:28:00,340
Lanxiang, you...

378
00:28:08,100 --> 00:28:08,979
Many years ago,

379
00:28:09,659 --> 00:28:10,820
I fell gravely ill.

380
00:28:11,540 --> 00:28:13,659
My parents took me
everywhere seeking treatment.

381
00:28:14,264 --> 00:28:15,900
When they had nowhere left to turn,

382
00:28:16,900 --> 00:28:18,648
they happened
to meet First Madam Shen.

383
00:28:18,979 --> 00:28:20,580
She gave my parents ten taels of silver,

384
00:28:21,580 --> 00:28:22,580
and that saved my life.

385
00:28:44,140 --> 00:28:45,179
Yes.

386
00:28:51,140 --> 00:28:52,979
I see.

387
00:28:53,448 --> 00:28:56,264
Mister Lu, would you like to burn
some paper offerings for your family?

388
00:29:10,979 --> 00:29:12,939
Every parent

389
00:29:15,540 --> 00:29:18,100
wants their children

390
00:29:18,659 --> 00:29:20,380
to live well.

391
00:29:22,979 --> 00:29:23,780
Lanxiang.

392
00:29:26,100 --> 00:29:27,620
Don't be like me

393
00:29:29,419 --> 00:29:31,179
and make your parents worry.

394
00:29:34,940 --> 00:29:41,860
♪Every word carries countless thoughts♪

395
00:29:43,699 --> 00:29:47,140
You should marry
and build a life of your own,

396
00:29:50,259 --> 00:29:52,540
have a house full
of children and grandchildren,

397
00:29:54,780 --> 00:29:57,620
and live a life filled
with warmth and laughter,

398
00:29:59,699 --> 00:30:01,620
a life full of purpose and passion.

399
00:30:01,620 --> 00:30:05,420
♪The joys and sorrows
of the past quietly dwell here♪

400
00:30:05,420 --> 00:30:10,100
♪With my own hands and heart♪

401
00:30:10,100 --> 00:30:13,460
♪I write my name♪

402
00:30:14,180 --> 00:30:20,900
♪Through countless lines of ink,
step by step toward the light♪

403
00:30:20,900 --> 00:30:25,180
♪With what I know and what I do♪

404
00:30:25,180 --> 00:30:28,420
♪I rewrite my fate♪

405
00:30:28,420 --> 00:30:39,060
♪The long night is almost over,
and I no longer dwell on the past♪

406
00:30:50,140 --> 00:30:56,860
♪Every word carries countless thoughts♪

407
00:30:57,540 --> 00:31:05,060
♪The encounters of half a lifetime
are kept within this little world♪

408
00:31:05,060 --> 00:31:12,260
♪Bit by bit, the passing years
become the preface♪

409
00:31:12,660 --> 00:31:15,140
♪The joys and sorrows of the past♪

410
00:31:15,140 --> 00:31:20,820
♪Quietly dwell here♪

411
00:31:20,820 --> 00:31:25,140
♪With my own hands and heart♪

412
00:31:25,140 --> 00:31:28,780
♪I write my name♪

413
00:31:29,180 --> 00:31:35,940
♪Through countless lines of ink,
step by step toward the light♪

414
00:31:35,940 --> 00:31:40,220
♪With what I know and what I do♪

415
00:31:40,220 --> 00:31:43,500
♪I rewrite my fate♪

416
00:31:43,500 --> 00:31:46,219
Lotus pods!

417
00:31:46,219 --> 00:31:47,740
(Half a Month Later)

418
00:31:47,848 --> 00:31:48,930
Lotus seeds and lotus pods!

419
00:31:49,340 --> 00:31:50,820
Fresh lotus seeds!

420
00:31:54,179 --> 00:31:54,979
Lotus seeds!

421
00:32:18,019 --> 00:32:18,820
My dear brother.

422
00:32:18,904 --> 00:32:20,440
There's only a wall between your homes.

423
00:32:20,620 --> 00:32:23,380
It's not as if Lanxiang's parents
don't know what you look like.

424
00:32:25,419 --> 00:32:27,259
The matchmaker
has already spoken to them,

425
00:32:27,659 --> 00:32:30,019
and Lanxiang's parents
have given their consent.

426
00:32:30,860 --> 00:32:32,219
What are you still nervous about?

427
00:32:32,290 --> 00:32:34,110
When a matchmaker
comes to discuss a marriage,

428
00:32:34,120 --> 00:32:36,184
it's only to ask
for the woman's family's consent.

429
00:32:36,190 --> 00:32:38,216
The betrothal gifts
must be formally presented

430
00:32:38,280 --> 00:32:39,820
before the marriage is truly settled.

431
00:32:41,179 --> 00:32:42,780
Surely you're not worried

432
00:32:42,780 --> 00:32:44,979
your future parents-in-law
will change their minds?

433
00:32:46,739 --> 00:32:47,419
All right.

434
00:32:47,419 --> 00:32:47,900
Then

435
00:32:48,060 --> 00:32:49,419
hurry and bring the wild goose.

436
00:32:49,580 --> 00:32:50,060
Let's go.

437
00:33:10,860 --> 00:33:11,620
Coming!

438
00:33:12,219 --> 00:33:13,019
Guihua.

439
00:33:14,140 --> 00:33:14,659
Come in.

440
00:33:14,780 --> 00:33:15,659
Come in, child.

441
00:33:25,939 --> 00:33:26,340
All right.

442
00:33:43,219 --> 00:33:45,019
The eldest son, Han Liang,

443
00:33:45,540 --> 00:33:47,300
has now come of age

444
00:33:47,739 --> 00:33:49,060
but has yet to take a wife.

445
00:33:49,448 --> 00:33:50,970
Your daughter has found favor with us,

446
00:33:51,419 --> 00:33:53,140
and we seek her hand for Liang.

447
00:33:53,540 --> 00:33:56,019
Following the ancestral rites
of the Han family,

448
00:33:56,340 --> 00:33:58,979
we present a wild goose today
as the betrothal token

449
00:34:00,900 --> 00:34:01,699
to seek...

450
00:34:27,896 --> 00:34:29,710
Why is everyone
heading to the Xu residence?

451
00:34:29,720 --> 00:34:31,340
Did they do something wrong?

452
00:34:39,419 --> 00:34:42,019
Xu Wanquan, receive the imperial decree.

453
00:34:54,139 --> 00:34:56,459
This is a decree
from the reigning Emperor.

454
00:34:56,700 --> 00:34:59,220
All of you,
kneel and receive the decree.

455
00:35:43,300 --> 00:35:46,180
By the Mandate of Heaven, the Emperor

456
00:35:46,539 --> 00:35:47,619
hereby decrees.

457
00:35:48,220 --> 00:35:51,459
Lin Jinqi,
Commander of the Shence Garrison,

458
00:35:51,750 --> 00:35:53,144
has served the realm with loyalty

459
00:35:53,192 --> 00:35:55,520
and rendered meritorious service
in protecting the Emperor.

460
00:35:55,539 --> 00:35:57,139
As he has reached the age of marriage,

461
00:35:57,820 --> 00:36:00,220
a virtuous lady
shall be chosen as his wife.

462
00:36:00,380 --> 00:36:03,419
Young Laday Xu, daughter of Xu Wanquan,

463
00:36:03,740 --> 00:36:05,419
is gentle and kind,

464
00:36:05,979 --> 00:36:07,780
virtuous and accomplished.

465
00:36:08,499 --> 00:36:10,660
To bring about this worthy union,

466
00:36:11,220 --> 00:36:14,419
she is hereby bestowed
in marriage to Lin Jinqi.

467
00:36:26,904 --> 00:36:29,848
It is hereby ordered that an auspicious
day be chosen for the wedding.

468
00:36:29,912 --> 00:36:31,260
May you live together in harmony,

469
00:36:31,660 --> 00:36:33,220
and not disappoint my expectations.

470
00:36:33,740 --> 00:36:35,579
Respect this decree.

471
00:36:38,660 --> 00:36:43,020
♪Flowers bloom unseen,
as they have before♪

472
00:36:44,980 --> 00:36:48,740
♪All the joys and sorrows come and go♪

473
00:36:49,500 --> 00:36:52,020
♪While loss leaves winter in the heart♪

474
00:36:52,780 --> 00:36:54,620
♪Though all the world may fade♪

475
00:36:54,620 --> 00:36:57,900
♪Time rolls on
as countless lives rush by♪

476
00:36:59,700 --> 00:37:04,060
♪Night winds wander
through the halls of long ago♪

477
00:37:09,340 --> 00:37:11,380
Xu Wanquan's daughter?

478
00:37:15,939 --> 00:37:16,579
Shunhua.

479
00:37:17,059 --> 00:37:19,619
I've thought of every
prominent family in Jinling,

480
00:37:20,740 --> 00:37:21,700
but I still can't think

481
00:37:22,499 --> 00:37:23,939
which Young Lady Xu this could be.

482
00:37:25,499 --> 00:37:27,019
A prominent family?

483
00:37:27,019 --> 00:37:31,140
♪Let the cold wind rage,
let the wild rain fall♪

484
00:37:31,420 --> 00:37:34,340
♪Let sorrow spill like shadows over all♪

485
00:37:34,459 --> 00:37:38,139
The daughter-in-law I chose so carefully

486
00:37:40,619 --> 00:37:42,860
turns out to be a maid?

487
00:37:50,220 --> 00:37:51,939
Xu Lanxiang is a maid?

488
00:37:52,459 --> 00:37:53,860
How could she be a maid?

489
00:37:54,979 --> 00:37:56,459
A maid...

490
00:37:56,459 --> 00:37:57,980
(Jiang Lantian, Lin Jinqi's Grandmother,
Old Madam of the Lin Family)

491
00:37:58,139 --> 00:37:58,740
A...

492
00:37:59,300 --> 00:38:00,380
maid...

493
00:38:03,939 --> 00:38:04,660
Aunt Shunhua!

494
00:38:05,752 --> 00:38:06,700
Go get a physician!

495
00:38:08,139 --> 00:38:09,019
Press her philtrum!

496
00:38:10,616 --> 00:38:11,530
- Mother!
- Guihua!

497
00:38:12,744 --> 00:38:13,570
- Mother!
- Guihua!

498
00:38:14,459 --> 00:38:15,419
Quick, get some water!

499
00:38:15,539 --> 00:38:16,059
Water!

500
00:38:16,059 --> 00:38:18,100
♪Let sorrow spill like shadows over all♪

501
00:38:18,100 --> 00:38:21,860
♪Let love fall to pieces,
let old anger burn away♪

502
00:38:22,780 --> 00:38:23,660
Why?

503
00:38:23,979 --> 00:38:25,700
Why did it turn out like this?

504
00:38:30,619 --> 00:38:31,419
How...

505
00:38:33,900 --> 00:38:35,300
How could this happen?

506
00:38:38,099 --> 00:38:39,979
Why did they make you go back?

507
00:38:41,260 --> 00:38:43,499
Why did this happen?

508
00:38:45,420 --> 00:38:48,180
♪And silver moonlight
to guide me through the night♪

509
00:38:48,180 --> 00:38:51,940
♪Let beginnings fade
as endings come to call♪

510
00:38:52,900 --> 00:38:53,900
It's all my fault.

511
00:38:54,900 --> 00:38:55,900
It's all my fault.

512
00:39:03,539 --> 00:39:04,260
Marriage has

513
00:39:04,504 --> 00:39:07,180
always been decided by the parents
and arranged by a matchmaker.

514
00:39:07,240 --> 00:39:09,512
I'll go to the county office
and see the magistrate.

515
00:39:09,960 --> 00:39:11,410
I'll ask them to petition the Emperor

516
00:39:11,619 --> 00:39:12,900
to revoke the imperial decree.

517
00:39:13,180 --> 00:39:14,380
We'll tell them that

518
00:39:14,440 --> 00:39:16,300
your father and I
won't agree to this marriage.

519
00:39:16,310 --> 00:39:18,300
We won't agree to the marriage between
you and Young Master Lin.

520
00:39:18,300 --> 00:39:18,979
No.

521
00:39:19,220 --> 00:39:20,499
No, it can't.

522
00:39:20,619 --> 00:39:22,019
We'll petition the Emperor

523
00:39:22,139 --> 00:39:23,300
to revoke the imperial decree.

524
00:39:23,300 --> 00:39:25,900
Yes, we'll go to the authorities
and return the imperial decree.

525
00:39:25,939 --> 00:39:26,539
Father.

526
00:39:27,059 --> 00:39:27,900
Mother, you can't.

527
00:39:27,900 --> 00:39:28,860
We'll return it.

528
00:39:28,930 --> 00:39:30,936
Yes, we'll go to the authorities!

529
00:39:30,968 --> 00:39:32,720
We'll give
the imperial decree back to them.

530
00:39:32,744 --> 00:39:33,130
You can't.

531
00:39:33,340 --> 00:39:34,059
Lanxiang.

532
00:39:34,059 --> 00:39:35,059
Uncle Xu. Aunt Xu.

533
00:39:40,419 --> 00:39:41,220
You mustn't go.

534
00:39:43,180 --> 00:39:43,860
Scholar Han...

535
00:39:45,660 --> 00:39:46,340
This...

536
00:39:47,939 --> 00:39:49,780
Our Xu family has wronged you.

537
00:39:52,059 --> 00:39:53,820
Even if it costs me my life today,

538
00:39:53,820 --> 00:39:55,860
I'm going to return
this imperial decree.

539
00:39:56,099 --> 00:39:56,619
Father.

540
00:39:56,620 --> 00:39:57,610
- Uncle Xu!
- Father!

541
00:39:57,620 --> 00:39:59,100
- I'm going to return it!
- Uncle Xu!

542
00:39:59,112 --> 00:39:59,848
Wanquan!

543
00:40:06,300 --> 00:40:08,139
Your wife may not be educated,

544
00:40:08,740 --> 00:40:10,139
but aren't you educated either?

545
00:40:11,939 --> 00:40:13,220
The Emperor's word is absolute,

546
00:40:13,220 --> 00:40:14,539
and his decree is law.

547
00:40:14,700 --> 00:40:15,740
Don't you know that?

548
00:40:17,939 --> 00:40:20,700
Even without an imperial decree
written in black and white,

549
00:40:21,260 --> 00:40:24,619
the Emperor's spoken word

550
00:40:25,939 --> 00:40:28,300
can never be taken back!

551
00:40:40,979 --> 00:40:43,099
You may be stubborn enough

552
00:40:43,619 --> 00:40:45,220
not to fear losing your heads,

553
00:40:49,380 --> 00:40:50,660
but what about Lanxiang?

554
00:40:52,260 --> 00:40:53,220
Lanxiang

555
00:40:54,539 --> 00:40:56,619
will lose her head along with you.

556
00:41:02,979 --> 00:41:03,740
Really?

557
00:41:07,139 --> 00:41:08,419
A father guides his children.

558
00:41:09,499 --> 00:41:10,539
When it comes to marriage,

559
00:41:11,260 --> 00:41:13,019
children must indeed obey their parents.

560
00:41:14,820 --> 00:41:16,139
But before that comes

561
00:41:16,296 --> 00:41:18,216
the sovereign's authority
over his subjects.

562
00:41:19,860 --> 00:41:22,180
All within the realm
are subjects of the sovereign.

563
00:41:23,660 --> 00:41:24,700
Everyone

564
00:41:26,700 --> 00:41:29,180
under Heaven must obey the Emperor.

565
00:41:33,740 --> 00:41:35,619
But what if the Emperor is wrong?

566
00:41:42,539 --> 00:41:44,260
How could the Emperor be wrong?

567
00:41:47,640 --> 00:41:49,090
Whether thunder or gentle rain,

568
00:41:49,624 --> 00:41:50,930
all are the sovereign's grace.

569
00:41:52,619 --> 00:41:54,099
If anyone thinks otherwise,

570
00:41:56,499 --> 00:41:58,059
then that person must be wrong.

571
00:41:58,139 --> 00:41:59,579
And that person deserves to die.

572
00:42:06,780 --> 00:42:08,939
I can't bear to see you go back there.

573
00:42:11,780 --> 00:42:12,939
I'll be fine,

574
00:42:13,900 --> 00:42:14,660
Mother.

575
00:42:15,939 --> 00:42:16,900
I'll be fine.

576
00:42:19,700 --> 00:42:20,700
I'll be fine, Father.

577
00:42:22,700 --> 00:42:24,579
I'm only entering
the Lin Residence again.

578
00:42:25,539 --> 00:42:26,660
Last time I entered,

579
00:42:27,700 --> 00:42:29,780
I survived perfectly well
even as a maid.

580
00:42:31,300 --> 00:42:32,019
This time,

581
00:42:33,419 --> 00:42:35,099
I'm going there as a Young Madam.

582
00:42:37,419 --> 00:42:38,820
I'll live an even better life.

583
00:42:47,660 --> 00:42:48,340
I'll be fine.

584
00:42:50,579 --> 00:42:51,300
I'll be fine.

585
00:42:53,860 --> 00:42:54,579
I'll be fine.

586
00:42:59,220 --> 00:42:59,939
I'll be fine.

587
00:43:05,300 --> 00:43:07,340
=Against the Current=
(Next Episode's Preview)

588
00:43:08,459 --> 00:43:09,539
I love Young Laday Xu

589
00:43:10,260 --> 00:43:11,340
and want to marry her.

590
00:43:12,220 --> 00:43:13,979
I knew parents and elders
would never agree,

591
00:43:14,820 --> 00:43:16,019
so I came up with this plan

592
00:43:16,216 --> 00:43:17,970
to bypass the elders of the family

593
00:43:18,232 --> 00:43:20,552
and petition His Majesty
directly for an imperial decree.

594
00:43:23,740 --> 00:43:24,579
You unfilial son.

595
00:43:25,340 --> 00:43:27,019
Look at the unfilial son you've raised!

596
00:43:31,220 --> 00:43:32,900
For your own selfish desires,

597
00:43:32,970 --> 00:43:34,792
you arranged your marriage
without telling us,

598
00:43:34,840 --> 00:43:36,472
disregarding the family's reputation

599
00:43:36,610 --> 00:43:38,536
and everything
your parents have done for you.

600
00:43:38,700 --> 00:43:40,979
This is a grave act of filial impiety!

601
00:43:57,020 --> 00:44:01,140
♪Spring slips from the
branches once more♪

602
00:44:03,980 --> 00:44:08,500
♪Flowers bloom unseen,
as they have before♪

603
00:44:09,780 --> 00:44:13,700
♪All the joys and sorrows come and go♪

604
00:44:14,380 --> 00:44:17,140
♪While loss leaves winter in the heart♪

605
00:44:17,860 --> 00:44:20,180
♪Though all the world may fade♪

606
00:44:20,180 --> 00:44:23,260
♪Time rolls on as
countless lives rush by♪

607
00:44:24,780 --> 00:44:29,020
♪Night winds wander
through the halls of long ago♪

608
00:44:31,940 --> 00:44:36,100
♪No page could hold the
longing words can never show♪

609
00:44:37,900 --> 00:44:41,460
♪Every joy and sorrow
in this fleeting life♪

610
00:44:41,460 --> 00:44:45,020
♪Fades into the past
as new wounds rise♪

611
00:44:45,820 --> 00:44:51,500
♪While whispers of perfume
linger beneath the eaves♪

612
00:44:51,860 --> 00:44:56,180
♪Let the cold wind rage,
let the wild rain fall♪

613
00:44:56,540 --> 00:44:59,500
♪Let sorrow spill like shadows over all♪

614
00:44:59,500 --> 00:45:03,260
♪Let love fall to pieces,
let old anger burn away♪

615
00:45:03,260 --> 00:45:06,140
♪Let the past die with yesterday♪

616
00:45:06,140 --> 00:45:10,220
♪One last fire, one last cup of wine♪

617
00:45:10,220 --> 00:45:13,580
♪And silver moonlight to
guide me through the night♪

618
00:45:13,580 --> 00:45:17,340
♪Let beginnings fade
as endings come to call♪

619
00:45:17,340 --> 00:45:21,340
♪From this endless dream,
there's no return at all♪

